    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660591911</dc:date>
    <skos:definition>participants fixate on a cross in the center of a screen while a visual cue appears elsewhere on screen; they are instructed that once the fixation cross disappears, they are to direct a saccade to the place where the cue had been</skos:definition>
