    <dc:Title>picture-word Stroop test</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>participants view line drawings of commons objects paired with either congruent or incongruent names thereof (e.g. a drawing of an umbrella with the word &amp;#34;BALLOON&amp;#34; or &amp;#34;UMBRELLA&amp;#34; above it)</skos:definition>
    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660588756</dc:date>
