    <dc:Title>retention</dc:Title>
    <skos:prefLabel>retention</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>a preservation of the aftereffects of experience and learning that makes recall or recognition possible.&#13;
Persistence of learned behavior or experience during a period when it is not being performed o r practiced.&#13;
Retention is the second stage of memory after encoding and before retrival</skos:definition>
    <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="#ctp_C5"/>
    <dc:Contributor>usr_4e429d2c8a0e5</dc:Contributor>
  </owl:Class>
