  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_4a3fd79d0b0f7">
    <skos:definition>A limited-capacity and short-lasting representation of information in the mind. The duration of short-term memory is on the order of seconds, while its capacity is on the order of 4 to 9 independent items.</skos:definition>
