    <dc:Date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660640337</dc:Date>
    <skos:definition>Balance allows humans to be able to orient the body in space, maintain an upright posture under static and dynamic conditions, and move without falling, by adjusting motoric control</skos:definition>
  </owl:Class>
