    <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="#ctp_C1"/>
    <skos:definition>being or inducing the one of the four basic taste sensations that is peculiarly acrid, astringent, or disagreeable; marked by intensity or severity; marked by cynicism and rancor; intensely unpleasant especially in coldness or rawness; expressive of severe pain, grief, or regret.</skos:definition>
