    <dc:Contributor>usr_4b9003ea0be96</dc:Contributor>
    <rdfs:label>recitation/repetition (overt)</rdfs:label>
    <dc:Title>recitation/repetition (overt)</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>Subjects repeat or recite phonemes, words, or well-known text (nursery rhymes, Pledge of Allegiance, months of the year, etc.) aloud.</skos:definition>
