    <dc:Contributor>usr_58c8092c0082a</dc:Contributor>
    <skos:definition>The revised Social Norm Processing Task (SNPT-R) is a paradigm enabling the study of behavioral and neural responses to intended and unintended social norm violations, among both adults and adolescence (Bas-Hoogendam et al., under review). </skos:definition>
