    <skos:altLabel>Pin tip stimulation</skos:altLabel>
    <dc:Title>mechanical stimulation</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>A mechanical stimulus is applied to the skin and the participant rates the experienced sensation on a visual analogue scale.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>mechanical stimulation</rdfs:label>
