    <rdfs:label>Chapman Perceptual Aberration Scale</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>assesses psychotic-like experiences such as bodily discontinuities and unusual scenery experiences (e.g., âI have felt that something outside my body was a part of my bodyâ). (from http://www.columbia.edu/cu/ssw/projects/pmap/docs/chmielewski_chapman.pdf)</skos:definition>
