  <owl:Class rdf:about="#tsk_4a57abb949b46">
    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660584942</dc:date>
    <skos:altLabel>matching pennies task</skos:altLabel>
    <dc:Title>matching pennies game </dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>The game is played between two players, Player A and Player B. Each player has a penny and must secretly turn the penny to heads or tails. The players then reveal their choices simultaneously. If the pennies match (both heads or both tails), Player A receives one dollar from Player B (+1 for A, -1 for B). If the pennies do not match (one heads and one tails), Player B receives one dollar from Player A (-1 for A, +1 for B). This is an example of a zero-sum game, where one player&amp;#39;s gain is exactly equal to the other player&amp;#39;s loss.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>matching pennies game </rdfs:label>
    <dc:identifier>tsk_4a57abb949b46</dc:identifier>
    <dc:Contributor>usr_49a467bf4e0db</dc:Contributor>
    <skos:prefLabel>matching pennies game </skos:prefLabel>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2cc168b758b54deda34ed4af151aaca8">
    <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://www.cogpo.org/ontologies/CogPOver1.owlhas_contrast"/>
    <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="#cnt_50eb562b899ef"/>
  </owl:Restriction>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_551b06cf9783b">
    <skos:altLabel>Visual search task</skos:altLabel>
    <dc:identifier>trm_551b06cf9783b</dc:identifier>
    <dc:Contributor>usr_4e42a3196fbcd</dc:Contributor>
    <dc:Title>Parallel/serial search</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>In a serial search, you look at one item at a time, and respond as soon as you see a target. In a parallel search, you look at multiple items at a time and the relevant aspect of the target can be detected quickly regardless of how many distractors there are.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Parallel/serial search</rdfs:label>
    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660596328</dc:date>
    <skos:prefLabel>Parallel/serial search</skos:prefLabel>
  </owl:Class>
