    <dc:Contributor>usr_51ba954cf0abe</dc:Contributor>
    <skos:definition>An aversive psychophysiological state characterized by fear, worry, or concern associated with current or impending threat often elicited by general and specific interoceptive or exteroceptive cues.</skos:definition>
