  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_4a3fd79d0a43c">
    <skos:definition>consists of the process of recognizing or inferring goals, abandoning no longer relevant goals, identifying and resolving conflicts among goals, and prioritizing goals consistently for optimal success.</skos:definition>
