    <rdfs:label>Tower of Hanoi</rdfs:label>
    <dc:identifier>trm_4da87e7282f92</dc:identifier>
    <dc:Title>Tower of Hanoi</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>participants see discs of various sizes distributed among three pegs and must organize them in a stack of decreasing size upward with specific constraints (i.e. only one disk can be moved at a time, each disk must be placed on one of the pegs, and a larger disk can never be placed on top&#13;
of a smaller disk)</skos:definition>
  </owl:Class>
