  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_59cd03eeeab30">
    <skos:definition>The participant has to judge which one from two events taken from a fictitious story took place first. &#13;
For this, the participant, need to be aware of the story.&#13;
This task probes mental Time Travel abilities.&#13;
&#13;
A variant of this task consists in ordering the events in space (North/south, East/West). </skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>Fictitious event ordering</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:Title>Fictitious event ordering</dc:Title>
    <dc:Contributor>usr_583366685f18a</dc:Contributor>
