    <dc:Contributor>usr_4a5bc4a2a8aba</dc:Contributor>
    <skos:definition>Knowledge that is descriptive and includes knowing &amp;#34;that&amp;#34; rather than knowing &amp;#34;how&amp;#34; (can be expressed in declarative sentences).</skos:definition>
