  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_4e31d031bc8c2">
    <skos:altLabel>simultaneity judgment task, SJ</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Participants decide whether the unimodal cues to a crossmodal event (stimulus) were in temporal synchrony or not, i.e., whether they were &amp;#34;in synch&amp;#34; or &amp;#34;out of synch&amp;#34;.</skos:definition>
