    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660592376</dc:date>
    <skos:definition>participants are shown faces expressing various emotions and asked to describe what emotion they believe is being expressed, sometimes also in conjunction with physiological (including neurophysiological) measures</skos:definition>
