    <skos:prefLabel>category learning</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:Title>category learning</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>is a strategy which requires a learner to compare and contrast groups or categories that contain concept-relevant features with groups or categories that do not contain concept-relevant features.&#13;
</skos:definition>
