    <skos:definition>The failure to process an external stimulus (often refers to sensory stimuli).</skos:definition>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_4a3fd79d0b09a">
    <dc:Date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660635150</dc:Date>
    <skos:definition>brief storage of sensory information in each of the senses, which temporarily holds material (e.g., a perceptual experience) for recoding into another memory (such as short-term memory) or for comprehension.</skos:definition>
