  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_4da886fc2bc46">
    <rdfs:label>Visual Patterns Test</rdfs:label>
    <skos:prefLabel>Visual Patterns Test</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:Title>Visual Patterns Test</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>is a measure of short term visual memory that has been designed for use both as a clinical tool and a research instrument.  In the VPT, the subject is presented with matrix patterns of black and white squares in grids of varying size and required to memorize a series of black and white checkerboard-like patterns of increasing complexity. Such matrix patterns are virtually impossible to code verbally.</skos:definition>
    <dc:identifier>trm_4da886fc2bc46</dc:identifier>
    <dc:Contributor>usr_4cf5de07654c8</dc:Contributor>
    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660587865</dc:date>
  </owl:Class>
