    <skos:definition>The Expressive One Word-Picture Vocabulary Test assesses English speaking vocabulary and verbal intelligence for individuals age 2 to 95 years.&#13;
&#13;
http://portal.wpspublish.com/portal/page?_pageid=53,272879&amp;_dad=portal&amp;_schema=PORTAL&#13;
</skos:definition>
  </owl:Class>
