    <rdfs:label>color-discrimination task</rdfs:label>
    <skos:prefLabel>color-discrimination task</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:Title>color-discrimination task</dc:Title>
    <dc:Contributor>usr_49a467bf4e0db</dc:Contributor>
    <skos:definition>is a behavioral task where a subject is to make specific responses when presented with particular colors.  The responses to the various colors are then evaluated to see if the subject was able to discern between different colors.    </skos:definition>
