    <dc:Contributor>usr_51bc76ae9636c</dc:Contributor>
    <skos:definition>the ability for a person to connect emotional states to themselves and others and understand that other people may have different  beliefs, desires, or intentions from one&amp;#39;s self.  It is intimately connected with the development of a person&amp;#39;s ability to analyze and interpret the intentions of others.</skos:definition>
