    <dc:Title>Food cue reactivity</dc:Title>
    <skos:definition>Brain response to food cues minus the response to non-food cues (often visual, but could also be olfactory) or an appropriate control cue (e.g. a a small amount of a tasteless control solution).</skos:definition>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N5c7a8a25190a4c05a04a0bcce322ce47">
