  <owl:Class rdf:about="#trm_4fe8edc62f613">
    <skos:definition>the phenomenon by which a response to a conditional stimulus presented in absence of the unconditional stimulus diminishes over time; rather than a forgetting, it is generally believed to be a new learning.</skos:definition>
