    <skos:definition>is the ability to perceive an objectâs physical properties (such as shape, colour and texture) and apply semantic attributes to the object, which includes the understanding of its use, previous experience with the object and how it relates to others.&#13;
</skos:definition>
    <skos:altLabel>object identification</skos:altLabel>
  </owl:Class>
