    <skos:definition>the components of the central and peripheral nervous systems that receive and interpret sensory information from organs in the joints, ligaments, muscles, and skin. This system processes information about the length, degree of stretch, tension, and contraction of muscles; pain; temperature; pressure; and joint position.</skos:definition>
    <dc:Title>somatosensation</dc:Title>
    <skos:hasTopConcept rdf:resource="#ctp_C1"/>
    <skos:prefLabel>somatosensation</skos:prefLabel>
