    <dc:Title>zimbardo time perspective inventory</dc:Title>
    <dc:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1512660600247</dc:date>
    <skos:definition>A 56-item questionnaire that measures attitude towards time perspective across five domains: past-negative, present-hedonistic, future, past-positive, and present-fatalistic.&#13;
&#13;
ZTPI: Zimbardo Time Perspective Inventory&#13;
http://psycnet.apa.org/journals/psp/77/6/1271.pdf</skos:definition>
